  repository (mathesisstoicheion/packs, folder noncommercial/), whose README labels it the same way.
- Biblioteca Medicea Laurenziana, Plut. 32.9 (Teca digitale) and Bibliothèque nationale de France,
  grec 1807 (Gallica): photographs for non-commercial use, linked, not copied.


