WHAT THIS SITE CHANGED

As CC BY-SA asks, the changes made to the material above:
- Texts are split into citable passages and lined up with their translations. Their words are not
  changed.
- LSJ entries keep their wording; Beta Code is turned into Greek letters, and a short gloss is taken
  from each entry for the look-up.
- Indexes, counts and search files are derived from the texts.
- Works named only in Latin or Greek get an English title; most of these are this site's own
  translations and are labelled so on the site.
